---
// src/pages/accessibility.astro
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import { site } from "../data/site.js";
---

<Base
  title="Accessibility Statement — Swaim Engineering and Surveying"
  description="Swaim Engineering and Surveying is committed to keeping this website usable by the broadest possible audience, following WCAG 2.1 Level AA."
>
  <section class="doc">
    <p class="label">ADA Accessibility Statement</p>
    <h1>Committed to an inclusive digital experience</h1>
    <p class="doc-lede">
      Accessibility is a priority, not an option.
    </p>

    <div class="doc-body">
      <p>
        We believe the internet should be accessible to everyone, regardless of ability or
        circumstance. Our team is committed to ensuring this website can be used by the broadest
        possible audience.
      </p>
      <p>
        To support this commitment, we strive to follow the Web Content Accessibility Guidelines
        (WCAG) 2.1, Level AA. These internationally recognized guidelines outline best practices
        for making digital content more accessible to individuals with a wide range of
        disabilities.
      </p>
      <p>
        We perform regular scans and assessments of our website to help ensure ongoing compliance
        with WCAG 2.1 standards.
      </p>
      <p>
        Our goal is to support a broad range of browsers and assistive technologies, allowing
        users to access the site using the tools that work best for them. We aim to minimize any
        barriers to access.
      </p>
      <p>
        While we work diligently to maintain and improve accessibility, some areas of the site may
        not yet be fully optimized. Enhancing accessibility is an ongoing process, and we are
        actively working toward full compliance.
      </p>

      <h2>Tell us if something isn't working</h2>
      <p>
        If you encounter any accessibility issue or have a suggestion for improvement, we welcome
        your feedback. Email us at <a href={site.emailHref}>{site.email}</a> or call the office at 
        <a href={site.phoneHref}> {site.phone}</a>, and we'll work with you to get you the
        information you need.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .doc {
    max-width: calc(46rem + var(--pad) * 2);
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: clamp(3rem, 8vw, 5.5rem) var(--pad) clamp(4rem, 9vw, 6.5rem);
  }
  .doc h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4.6vw, 3rem);
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .doc-lede {
    margin: 1.25rem 0 0;
    font-family: var(--display);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: clamp(1.15rem, 2.2vw, 1.5rem);
    line-height: 1.35;
    opacity: 0.85;
  }
  .doc-body {
    margin-top: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--hair-ink);
    padding-top: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 2.75rem);
  }
  .doc-body p { margin: 0 0 1.35rem; opacity: 0.82; }
  .doc-body p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
  .doc-body h2 {
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin: 2.5rem 0 1rem;
  }
  .doc-body a { color: var(--flag); text-decoration: none; }
  .doc-body a:hover { text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 4px; }
</style>
